        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=2)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   They didn't just catch up to us...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "They didn't just catch up to us..."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   They're...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "They're..."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   --Everywhere.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "--Everywhere."
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[PlaySound(key=\"$d_gen_soldiersrun\",volume=1)]",
        "type": "play_sound",
        "key": "sound_beta_2/avg/d_gen_soldiersrun.mp3",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\",name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\",fadetime=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=2)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   From the plaza, the streets, the buildings... and even all the ruins.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "From the plaza, the streets, the buildings... and even all the ruins."
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   Look at those numbers. Hah...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Look at those numbers. Hah..."
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   That explains why they weren't afraid of the Catastrophe at all, except for the ones who ended up being crushed.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "That explains why they weren't afraid of the Catastrophe at all, except for the ones who ended up being crushed."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   Even if we assume...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Even if we assume..."
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   That the Catastrophe wiped out half their men--",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "That the Catastrophe wiped out half their men--"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   They still have enough people here to kill us a dozen times over.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "They still have enough people here to kill us a dozen times over."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   Don't stop moving! We'll continue moving towards our retreat route!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "Don't stop moving! We'll continue moving towards our retreat route!"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   We're done for if we stop in a wide-open area! At least make it to the plaza's exit before regrouping!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "We're done for if we stop in a wide-open area! At least make it to the plaza's exit before regrouping!"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#3\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Nearl...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Nearl..."
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#3\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   We have to fight. After we break through their line, we'll slip out in the ensuing chaos.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "We have to fight. After we break through their line, we'll slip out in the ensuing chaos."
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#3\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Are you sure it'll work?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Are you sure it'll work?"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#3\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   The chance is slim, but we're out of options. But...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "The chance is slim, but we're out of options. But..."
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   Even if they outnumber us ten-to-one, if they're just a bunch of thugs, we still have a chance!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "Even if they outnumber us ten-to-one, if they're just a bunch of thugs, we still have a chance!"
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   Stay calm! Prepare for battle! Defensive formations!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "Stay calm! Prepare for battle! Defensive formations!"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   ...Tsk.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "...Tsk."
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   With these numbers, if they wanted to take over Chernobog... they might actually be able to do it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "With these numbers, if they wanted to take over Chernobog... they might actually be able to do it."
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   There are too many...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "There are too many..."
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   Way too many of them..",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "Way too many of them.."
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   Where did Reunion find all these Infected?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "Where did Reunion find all these Infected?"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   We're completely surrounded...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "We're completely surrounded..."
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   I never asked for this kind of respect from Reunion.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "I never asked for this kind of respect from Reunion."
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_013_riop\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   The entire plaza... is swarming with Reunion forces!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "The entire plaza... is swarming with Reunion forces!"
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   They've stopped moving!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "They've stopped moving!"
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Ugh...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Ugh..."
    },
